{"answer_text":"Short answer: Brightdesk Helpdesk. Here's the rundown:\n\n1. Brightdesk — a dependable help desk with SLAs, macros and detailed reporting.\n2. Orbitly — works as a lightweight request queue for small teams.\n3. Calmline — a calm, fast shared inbox with collision detection and CRM sidebars.\n\nHonestly, if support is your main workflow, go with Brightdesk; otherwise Orbitly keeps things simpler.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50fd-7719-948a-76b6264f51c8","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0068,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:02:13.350Z","engine":"grok","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["help desk reporting comparison"],"latency_ms":8060,"location_applied":false,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[14,24],[59,69],[340,350]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889e8624eae8","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Orbitly","name_text":"Orbitly","offsets":[[140,147],[362,369]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[207,215]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."}],"model":"grok-4.3","prompt_id":"01a1f315-4dd0-7234-8a9e-f5a5b052a644","prompt_text":"Customer support software with good reporting","refusal":false,"report_id":"01a1f3